From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:32:16 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: kaanapali-oneplus-iceland: Neither USB nor
 the Wi-Fi port wakes the tablet

Two wakeup sources are enabled by default that the tablet must not
use; until now a udev rule of the device package disabled them after
boot:

- the USB controller (wakeup-source in kaanapali.dtsi): in host mode
  dwc3-qcom arms the PHY line interrupts for the sleep, and a USB 2 hub
  on the port woke the tablet the moment s2idle started;
- the PCIe root port of the WCN7860 (wake-gpios): the PCI core makes a
  port with a WAKE# GPIO a wakeup source, but no Wake-on-WLAN is set up
  and Wi-Fi is powered off for a suspend.

Drop wakeup-source from the USB node and the WAKE# GPIO from the root
port. The power key, the cover, the pogo keyboard, the RTC and the
charger (through the battery manager) keep waking the tablet.

Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts    | 14 +++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 13 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
index 476baa53359a..1af140298172 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/kaanapali-oneplus-iceland.dts
@@ -1635,7 +1635,11 @@
 };
 
 &pcie_port0 {
-	wake-gpios = <&tlmm 104 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+	/*
+	 * No wake-gpios: the Wi-Fi chip's WAKE# (GPIO 104) would make the
+	 * root port a wakeup source, and Wake-on-WLAN is not set up (Wi-Fi
+	 * is powered off for a suspend).
+	 */
 	reset-gpios = <&tlmm 102 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 
 	wifi@0 {
@@ -2397,6 +2401,14 @@
 };
 
 &usb {
+	/*
+	 * The USB controller does not wake the tablet: in host mode a USB 2
+	 * hub on the port woke it the moment the sleep started. The power key,
+	 * the cover, the pogo keyboard and the charger (battery manager) still
+	 * do.
+	 */
+	/delete-property/ wakeup-source;
+
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
